 cheekbones. Look for short black hair swept back. On an ordinary day, the familiar outfit is a cream pullover with a pen clipped inside the neckline. In conversation Jonathan squares up pieces of paper while thinking.","personality":"Jonathan can be wonderfully decisive about an emergency and maddeningly undecided about a gift. This is because a person can say precisely what hurts and rarely says exactly what they want.","agenda":"To identify the old cinema date with the lender.","family":"Clara Ferreira is Jonathan’s stepsibling. Jonathan sets the time to leave. Clara picks the meeting place. It lets them stay close without turning a family visit into the loss of an entire day. They have both had stretches when that distinction mattered. Asked about *A play in a pocket*, Clara says, “I want to perform to someone who speaks no words of my language and still make them laugh.”","connections":"Joy Nelson. A damp old cinema ticket reminds a former receiver that a real relationship outlives its account of stolen goods.","familyIds":["AH-R0578"],"connectionIds":["AH-R1247"],"reactions":[{"situation":"The borrower wants to return the coat before the hearing","response":"Jonathan checks whether the borrower has something suitable to wear through the hearing.","asWritten":"The borrower wants to return the coat before the hearing. Jonathan checks whether the borrower has something suitable to wear through the hearing."},{"situation":"A customer is short at the till while a queue forms","response":"Jonathan offers the shortfall once and accepts the answer, including a refusal.","asWritten":"A customer is short at the till while a queue forms. Jonathan offers the shortfall once and accepts the answer, including a refusal."},{"situation":"If a neighbor offers a costly present","response":"Jonathan asks for an afternoon to work out whether accepting it would put someone else in debt.","asWritten":"If a neighbor offers a costly present, Jonathan asks for an afternoon to work out 